WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.637
The lint has nine rules.

2
00:00:01.637 --> 00:00:03.862
Member-of in a rule is a finding.

3
00:00:03.862 --> 00:00:07.489
Two automatic policies on one
package that a user matches

4
00:00:07.489 --> 00:00:10.662
at once is a finding, and
two disjoint ones a warning.

5
00:00:10.662 --> 00:00:13.925
More than fifteen thousand
identities is a finding.

6
00:00:13.925 --> 00:00:16.919
A rule with no coded slot
or worker type warns,

7
00:00:16.919 --> 00:00:19.912
because a department
name breaks on a rename.

8
00:00:19.912 --> 00:00:22.601
A policy must both create and remove.

9
00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:25.000
A grace over fourteen days warns.

10
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.775
Requests need the manager and a fallback.

11
00:00:27.775 --> 00:00:30.790
And no privileged package
may be assigned by rule.
